From 2e4d8906be5dfccfec284f9dcc1e39644d25ae68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mempool: defer FlushPendingOverlayAdds in
 SyncMerklixOverlayToTip until overlay read

Keep SyncMerklixOverlayToTip O(1) during block connect and tip updates by
deferring pending Merklix overlay flushes until a template or sync reader
queries the overlay.

Original-Commit: 182b61908f156c240116fd49f53abc4220f95831
Original-Patch: ecash/038
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Application-Repair: Preserve original endpoint warm-overlay/tip-reset implementation and supply its missing declaration/atomic warm flag at first owner. Keep the existing single generic bulk-clear implementation; omit the second accidental duplicate definition containing V2 token-input nFlags (absent in eCash). Token-input adapter is tracked for actual V2 transaction owner. Retain COW publication bookkeeping and every original assertion.

Plan-v2 owner repair: B6: a contended overlay warm logs its deferred status; readers flush pending changes.
---
 src/test/mempool_tests.cpp | 26 ++++++++++++
 src/txmempool.cpp          | 84 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 src/txmempool.h            |  4 ++
 3 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/test/mempool_tests.cpp b/src/test/mempool_tests.cpp
